{"overview":"این سریال داستان روابط چند خانم است که در همسایگی یکدیگر زندگی می کنند و روابط جالبی از قبیل عشق ، دوستی ، دشمنی، همدردی و رقابت بر سر عشق با یکدیگر دارند. راز های زندگی این چند خانم که در همسایگی هم زندگی می کنند و هر کدام داستان زندگی خود را دنبال می کنند که در نهایت به نوعی با یکدیگر در رابطه است .","tagline":"","overview_en":"Looking down on her friends and family isn't a way of life for Mary Alice Young... it's a way of death. One day, in her perfect house, in the loveliest of suburbs, Mary Alice ended it all. Now she's taking us into the lives of her family, friends and neighbors, commenting from her elevated P.O.V.","tagline_en":"Secrets. Romance. Murder. All on one street","runtime":42,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":53,"y":null,"poster":"/xKf5DDOEhPYbwvqqsYLvkwKxNzf.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":23,"y":2004,"poster":"/loERayOsYU1xdTH2JLOuug1vHIK.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":23,"y":2005,"poster":"/v3Yi3CqcKRr0pis0xnyNavnZj3D.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":23,"y":2006,"poster":"/4Q64W87EgCaEjWMI9foQ4PI3NiN.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":17,"y":2007,"poster":"/z7a9U2OLfOJyCrLzyiVcLUfgHBL.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":24,"y":2008,"poster":"/bkoReBnRmXzHXMoGLCQI84lisQR.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":23,"y":2009,"poster":"/aDEPAc5DJjiXW1pcc7ZCeyGcbSE.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":22,"y":2010,"poster":"/8NzsZHHuCPITnaqoHw9ZvaNccy9.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":22,"y":2011,"poster":"/nE3u1yRwBL6ymNrnhaJIqggnIHm.jpg"}],"episodes":177,"crew":["مارک چری"],"crew_en":["Marc Cherry"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"تری هچر","role":"Susan Mayer","photo":"/ySmnfZm8ZGabcwp4UwaMDeSzXqx.jpg","en":"Teri Hatcher"},{"name":"فلیسیتی هافمن","role":"Lynette Scavo","photo":"/jiNWZu8YZqOKRHaxRM4tbvBKyfP.jpg","en":"Felicity Huffman"},{"name":"مارسیا کراس","role":"Bree Van de Kamp","photo":"/dyO9omkRdr2uJMzHo7wvSjOBHPG.jpg","en":"Marcia Cross"},{"name":"اوا لونگوریا","role":"Gabrielle Solis","photo":"/1u26GLWK1DE7gBugyI9P3